{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行大号白字首先入眼，金色高亮的“憋着一股气”最醒目；随后下方同样醒目的灰白大标题争夺注意。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他心里仍憋着一股气，想起从前有人把他当作自己人，短暂地高兴了一下。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、有怨气，同时因被接纳的回忆短暂高兴。\",\n  \"missed\": \"那点高兴很快转成心酸；从前的日子已经回不去，也不确定离开以后是否真的会更好。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块字号和亮度都很高的大标题争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心情绪从短暂高兴转为心酸，分散在上下两块大标题里，需要拼起来才完整。\",\n    \"上方单块标题较长，内部包含怨气、回忆、被接纳、短暂高兴等多层意思。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "07725fe6-504e-4a1f-9f9c-9c4e63f3e041", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T013851823482Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.109, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:39:30.934465+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "aa8815f548c7d6482616c01c7bb937d32cdea0d3304c9be485f750c17d2c0d1b", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen